      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/El_Rio%2C_California",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "El Rio sits where the historic coastal railroad crossed the Santa Clara River, a spot that later became the Ventura Freeway.",
